  "content": "\n\n<section>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a>&nbsp;| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-weathering-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Weathering</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grounded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grounded</a><br>| <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unearthed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unearthed</a></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1566/835/dtsoilscompat-png.png\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fA4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p>本模组使 Soils 模组与 Dynamic Trees 兼容。<br>通过使用树木包（Tree Packs），可以自定义和调整树木、其行为及生成方式。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3><strong>内置兼容性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Immersive Weathering</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Grounded</span></li>\n<li>Unearthed</li>\n<li>Teletubbies Mod</li>\n<li>Supplementaries</li>\n<li>Lunar Nether</li>\n<li>Minecolonies</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>其他插件</strong>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p>其他模组的 Dynamic Trees 插件可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Dynamic Trees Wiki</a> 中找到。</p>\n<h4><strong>建议与请求：</strong></h4>\n<p>如需申请新增模组兼容性，请在此处提交：<a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>！！<br>在 CurseForge 评论区提交的意见将<strong>不会</strong>被采纳（抱歉！）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>前置要求</strong></h2>\n<p>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a></p>\n<h2><strong>可选依赖</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-weathering-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Weathering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grounded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grounded</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unearthed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unearthed</a>（仅限 1.20.1）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/teletubbies-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Teletubbies Mod</a>（仅限 1.20.1）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>（仅限 1.20.1）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lunar-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lunar Nether</a>（仅限 1.20.1）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecolonies</a>（仅限 1.20.1）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>许可协议与整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>您可以将其用于任何您喜欢的整合包中！无需事先询问。<br>本模组采用<strong>MIT</strong> 许可证，源代码已在 GitHub 上公开。</p>\n</section>",
